From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gloat <4354076+gloat@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 08:55:31 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] actions: hide-window, show-window, toggle-touchpad; `niri msg
 touchpad`

hide-window [--id] takes a window out of its workspace without closing it; show-window [--id]
brings it back (default: the most recently hidden) on the focused workspace, focused, with the
open animation, floating or tiled as before. Hidden windows live in Layout::hidden: listed over
IPC with no workspace id, kept current on commit, forgotten when unmapped or destroyed, and out of
reach of every other action and request (they are not in windows() or find_window_and_output()).

toggle-touchpad turns the touchpad off or back on on top of the config; `niri msg touchpad`
(or -j) reports whether it is on.
